<title>GERMANY: Germany's RTL TV plans holding company - report.</title>
<headline>Germany's RTL TV plans holding company - report.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>RTL, Germany's top television station, wants to tie two smaller sister stations into a single holding company which could eventually be listed on the stock market, chief executive Helmut Thoma said in a magazine interview.</p>
<p>Thoma told Monday's edition of Focus magazine that over the next few months work would continue on including RTL2 and family station Super RTL &quot;under one hat.&quot;</p>
